Changes relative to upstream:
- Fixed time-bound access never being revoked when the expiry message
  was missed: the catch-up sweep now derives its look-back from the
  configured timeOptions, paginates, tolerates malformed messages, and
  runs on an interval rather than only at startup.
- Direct message commands (`list`, `request`, `help`) for
  selfServeApproval profiles, sharing the App Home grant path.
- Duration validation against the profile's configured timeOptions.
- A unit test suite and a GHCR workflow publishing SHA-tagged images.

Both changes have been offered upstream.
